(text "WIZ850io: two 1x6 sockets. Check the J1-J2 spacing against the WIZnet mechanical drawing before layout." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a6ad995c-bc00-49c2-b080-ae6e1c939102))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 68020ffb-6aa4-4852-b0b0-13446ef48b96))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3f259cf2-5479-4ada-9363-efacb5727a7c))
